            <p>Delivery Hero's operational ecosystem is the invisible engine powering millions of daily deliveries. Designing for this environment meant creating universal solutions that worked seamlessly across highly diverse markets: MENA, LATAM, APAC, and Europe. Each region had its own legal regulations, work cultures, and operational constraints, demanding a perfect balance between global standardization and local adaptation.</p>
