            </div>
            <img src="img/Delivery-DesignSystem.jpg" alt="Design Systems and Architecture" class="img-responsive" />
            <div class="h-30"></div>
            <p><strong>Ecosystem Standardization:</strong> I was the sole creator and lead developer of two global Design Systems from scratch. Working hand-in-hand with developers gave me deep technical knowledge to ensure components were viable, accessible, and scalable.</p>
            <p><strong>UX Excellence & DesignOps:</strong> I created a customizable UX Excellence Program, successfully standardizing practices across a team of 20+ designers. I implemented strict Version Control and branching in Figma, elevating the entire department's output. Pelican scaled so much that it now requires 7 designers operating strictly under my quality checks.</p>
            <div class="h-30"></div>
        </div>

